  "key": "AIN-207",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "Publish versioned-submission packages and rebuild the local application",
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "User superseded earlier publishing deferral: publish packages first, then rebuild and rerun the local application. Required: publish Shared canonical-removal implementation plus compatible dependency versions through the 18-package pipeline graph; update API/UI exact registry manifests and lockfiles; fresh registry installs and integrity verification; rerun relevant API/package checks/tests; rebuild and start local application including Feedback, verify health and actual runtime versioned source reader/no CanonicalSubmission export. Record migration status from live DB and preserve existing data/volumes. No production deployment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Observed before work: local DB already records 20261114000000-retire-canonical-submissions.ts, canonical table absent, zero legacySubmission archives and 77 feedback versions. This differs from the earlier handoff; do not infer who applied migration or replay/destructively repair it. Previous local-only rebuild partially started API/Feedback before user interrupt; replace temporary package overlay with registry-backed image. Existing AIN-206 full-test typecheck/static-script gaps remain separately tracked, no blanket merge-ready claim. Required predecessor AIN-205 Done. Broader AIN-3/95 and financial/deployment epics remain outstanding. No changed UI workflow/placement; backend/runtime evidence instead of artificial screenshots."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
